{"4206150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Princess Factory", "steam_appid": 4206150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Princess Factory is an anomaly-detection horror game where you work in a mysterious factory beneath an abandoned fairy-tale theme park. You must check each princess animatronic for aberrations while trying to uncover the dark secrets of the park. Your actions may determine far more than simply whether or not you get out alive...but which path will you choose?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check the Princesses, Find Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/f0b8abc1401b6e8576bd58b2fa555a4f.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/f0b8abc1401b6e8576bd58b2fa555a4f.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/f0b8abc1401b6e8576bd58b2fa555a4f.mp4?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies abound. Some are easy to spot (or hear), others not so much. Let too many slip past you, and you won't survive the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Four Days on the Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a211534678d76bf855f721a050984db1.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a211534678d76bf855f721a050984db1.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a211534678d76bf855f721a050984db1.mp4?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new princess type is added each day, making your tasks more and more difficult. Can you survive even when four different princesses are out to get you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel a Terrifying Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/9377c971c0f0ab9822b2f7384db16409.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/9377c971c0f0ab9822b2f7384db16409.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/9377c971c0f0ab9822b2f7384db16409.mp4?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the dark secret behind the Princess Factory? Uncover clues among the anomalies as you fight to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose How Your Fate Will Unfold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a7a4e4a94dee4202ef6408e801fa9f3b.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a7a4e4a94dee4202ef6408e801fa9f3b.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two playthroughs will be the same, and there are multiple endings to unlock. How the story ends is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized events to make each playthrough unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art (not AI!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting (also not AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music (also not AI, safe for streaming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing mystery to unravel as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different endings determined by your choices</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Princess Factory is an anomaly-detection horror game where you work in a mysterious factory beneath an abandoned fairy-tale theme park. You must check each princess animatronic for aberrations while trying to uncover the dark secrets of the park. Your actions may determine far more than simply whether or not you get out alive...but which path will you choose?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check the Princesses, Find Anomalies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/f0b8abc1401b6e8576bd58b2fa555a4f.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/f0b8abc1401b6e8576bd58b2fa555a4f.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/f0b8abc1401b6e8576bd58b2fa555a4f.mp4?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies abound. Some are easy to spot (or hear), others not so much. Let too many slip past you, and you won't survive the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Four Days on the Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a211534678d76bf855f721a050984db1.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a211534678d76bf855f721a050984db1.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a211534678d76bf855f721a050984db1.mp4?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new princess type is added each day, making your tasks more and more difficult. Can you survive even when four different princesses are out to get you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel a Terrifying Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/9377c971c0f0ab9822b2f7384db16409.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/9377c971c0f0ab9822b2f7384db16409.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/9377c971c0f0ab9822b2f7384db16409.mp4?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the dark secret behind the Princess Factory? Uncover clues among the anomalies as you fight to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose How Your Fate Will Unfold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a7a4e4a94dee4202ef6408e801fa9f3b.poster.avif?t=1772831773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/extras/a7a4e4a94dee4202ef6408e801fa9f3b.webm?t=1772831773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two playthroughs will be the same, and there are multiple endings to unlock. How the story ends is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized events to make each playthrough unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art (not AI!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting (also not AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music (also not AI, safe for streaming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing mystery to unravel as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different endings determined by your choices</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Princess Factory is an anomaly-detection horror game where you check princess animatronics for errors in a mysterious factory beneath an abandoned fairy-tale theme park. Your actions may determine far more than simply whether or not you get out alive...but which path will you choose?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/9c9f32bc8c6a66d556753c5af9cbf7ca8aeaa78b/header.jpg?t=1772831773", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/e02c116884b5b9cafa47e3aedad93b3be4ffdaff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772831773", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206150/e02c116884b5b9cafa47e3aedad93b3be4ffdaff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772831773", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (2013 or newer) / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 / AMD Radeon HD 7770 (or integrated equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later (Windows 11 recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 (6th gen or newer) / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 290X / Intel HD Graphics 530 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1/M2) or Intel Core i5 (2015 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated (M-series GPU or Intel Iris Graphics)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1 or newer) or Intel Core i7 (2015 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon integrated GPU or Intel Iris Pro Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or equivalent (F